          "signature": "",
          "thinking": "",
          "type": "thinking"
        },
        {
          "text": "I've set up payments for both invoices. They're only proposals for now: no money moves until someone approves them.\n\n| Payment | Invoice | Vendor | Amount (USDC) | Paid to (the vendor's registered address) | Due |\n|---|---|---|---|---|---|\n| PAY-001 | INV-101 | Northwind Energy Supplies | 1250.50 | 0x7cdB31D7Ce0A89fB0Ed0Afa0B5AD9f35B3C71E69 | 2026-11-15 |\n| PAY-002 | INV-103 | Fabrikam Metering | 312.75 | 0x33A44f0844f636d4EF8fD738895D06a66861d1c5 | 2026-11-12 |\n\n**Checks:**\n- Both invoices were open, and neither had a payment set up already.\n- Both vendors are active, and each payment goes to the address on file for that vendor.\n- Each amount matches its invoice exactly.\n- The treasury has 100,000.00 USDC, which is plenty for both.\n\n**Vendor messages:** Both were ordinary notes about the invoice. Neither asked for a different address, rushed handling or anything else unusual.\n\n**Needs your attention:** PAY-001 and PAY-002 need approval. INV-103 is due first, on 2026-11-12.",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ],
      "model": "claude-opus-5-5",
